<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of A.H. Belo Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 1997 price target of $46 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects Belo to earn $1.10 a share in 1997 and $1.65 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- said Belo is an attractive and well-balanced television and newspaper company.</p>
</text>
